WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.110
All matter is made of tiny particles that never stop moving.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:08.560
In a solid, they are packed in fixed places, just vibrating.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:12.560
Heat it, and they slide past each other: a liquid.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.660
Heat more, and they fly apart to fill the space: a gas.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.500
Same particles, different motion.
